    "detailed_description": "Game Description:<br />\r\n3D horizontal board shooting fixed viewing angle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow it works:<br />\r\nFire: Left mouse button<br />\r\nMove: A/D<br />\r\nJump: W<br />\r\n<br />\r\nClearance Conditions:<br />\r\n1. Destroy all monsters that try to get close to plants.<br />\r\n2. Destroy monster lair.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnd Conditions:<br />\r\n1. Excessive blood loss.<br />\r\n2. Monsters infect plants.<br />\r\n2. Close the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPS: There are only 2 levels, so you can't save your progress! Sticking to the second level will be very easy and refreshing.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKeep firing, prioritize killing flying monsters, it's acceptable to take damage to a certain extent, and you can try more jumping and turning skills to maintain the continuity of the attack.",
    "about_the_game": "Game Description:<br />\r\n3D horizontal board shooting fixed viewing angle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow it works:<br />\r\nFire: Left mouse button<br />\r\nMove: A/D<br />\r\nJump: W<br />\r\n<br />\r\nClearance Conditions:<br />\r\n1. Destroy all monsters that try to get close to plants.<br />\r\n2. Destroy monster lair.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnd Conditions:<br />\r\n1. Excessive blood loss.<br />\r\n2. Monsters infect plants.<br />\r\n2. Close the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPS: There are only 2 levels, so you can't save your progress! Sticking to the second level will be very easy and refreshing.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKeep firing, prioritize killing flying monsters, it's acceptable to take damage to a certain extent, and you can try more jumping and turning skills to maintain the continuity of the attack.",
